{"path":"container/span/first","title":"std::span<T,Extent>::first","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::span&lt;T,Extent&gt;::</span>first","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/span/first","section":"container","kind":"page","summary":"Obtains a span that is a view over the first Count elements of this span. The program is ill-formed if Count > Extent. The behavior is undefined if Count > size().","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/size_t\"><span class=\"kw107\">std::<span class=\"me2\">size_t</span></span></a> Count <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/span\"><span class=\"kw2648\">std::<span class=\"me2\">span</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>element_type, Count<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> first<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/span\"><span class=\"kw2648\">std::<span class=\"me2\">span</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>element_type, <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/span/dynamic_extent\"><span class=\"kw2647\">std::<span class=\"me2\">dynamic_extent</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> first<span class=\"br0\">(</span> size_type Count <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Obtains a span that is a view over the first <code>Count</code> elements of this span. The program is ill-formed if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">Count <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> Extent</span></code>. The behavior is undefined if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">Count <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> size<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>A span <code>r</code> that is a view over the first <code>Count</code> elements of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>, such that <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">r.<span class=\"me1\">data</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> this<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>data<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> r.<span class=\"me1\">size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> Count</span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;ranges&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;span&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string_view&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> print<span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string_view\"><span class=\"kw1256\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string_view</span></span></a> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> title,\n           std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/forward_range\"><span class=\"kw2922\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">forward_range</span></span></a> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> container<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> size<span class=\"br0\">{</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/size\"><span class=\"kw689\">std::<span class=\"me2\">size</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>container<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> title <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'['</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> size <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"]{\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> elem <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> container<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> elem <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">--</span>size <span class=\"sy4\">?</span> <span class=\"st0\">\", \"</span> <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"};<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> run_game<span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/span\"><span class=\"kw2648\">std::<span class=\"me2\">span</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> span<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    print<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"span: \"</span>, span<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/span\"><span class=\"kw2648\">std::<span class=\"me2\">span</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">5</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> span_first <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> span.<span class=\"me1\">first</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nu0\">5</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    print<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"span.first&lt;5&gt;(): \"</span>, span_first<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/span\"><span class=\"kw2648\">std::<span class=\"me2\">span</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/span/dynamic_extent\"><span class=\"kw2647\">std::<span class=\"me2\">dynamic_extent</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> span_first_dynamic <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> span.<span class=\"me1\">first</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">4</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    print<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"span.first(4): \"</span>, span_first_dynamic<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> a<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"nu0\">8</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">3</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">4</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">5</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">6</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">7</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">8</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    print<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"int a\"</span>, a<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    run_game<span class=\"br0\">(</span>a<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>int a[8]{1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8};\nspan: [8]{1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8};\nspan.first&lt;5&gt;(): [5]{1, 2, 3, 4, 5};\nspan.first(4): [4]{1, 2, 3, 4};</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/span/last\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>last</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  obtains a subspan consisting of the last <code>N</code> elements of the sequence <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/span/subspan\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>subspan</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  obtains a subspan <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"container","title":"Containers library"},{"path":"container/span","title":"std::span"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::span<T,Extent>::first","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: since C++20. Obtains a span that is a view over the first Count elements of this span."},{"label":"Return value","note":"A span r that is a view over the first Count elements of *this